				"⣿⡏⠀⠀⠀",
				6,
				2
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Vine): Update branding to Land.PlayForm.Cloud domain\n\nUpdate all instance references in the Vine protocol documentation and README to reflect the new project branding. Change the Protocol Buffer package namespaces from `editor.land` to `land.playform.cloud` in both `Vine.proto` and `Spine.proto` definitions. Update all URLs, image assets, and contact email addresses in `README.md` and `Architecture.md` to use the `Land.PlayForm.Cloud` domain instead of `Editor.Land`.\n\nThis aligns the protocol specification and repository metadata with the new organization identity and ensures consistency across the documentation, build artifacts, and external links.",
			"SHA": "6898872a8fe363221220dfc9ebdcc274a8935b84"
		},
		{
